<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεῖγ-υς</span></b> , ὁ, Cret.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβυς</span>
			, <i>old man,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4992a
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 iii 2
			</span></i>; also in 
				Comp.
			, acc. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρείγονα</span>”
				<i>older,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Leg.Gort.
					12.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.414.9
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">v/iv B. C.</span>, dub. sens.), and 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρείγιστος</span>”
				<i>oldest,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Leg.Gort.
					7.23
				</span></i>
			, al.—Cogn. forms are <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεγγευτάς</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσγευτάς</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεισγευτάς</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβευτής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.599.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i> (Teos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5148.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5167.11
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρήγιστος</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβιστος</span>
			, <i>president,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5034.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλῆς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2562.23
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hierapytna</span>); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίγιστος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				1042
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi B. C.)</span>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσγέα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ,</span> Argive for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβεία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				56.38
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>). (For the etym. 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβυς</span>
			 fin.)</div>
